  "name": "Zul'Gurub: the Heart of Hakkar, prowlers, bats and Spawn of Mar'li scale with difficulty and raid size",
  "contract": [
    "The round-5 testers found the Heart of Hakkar (92005), Arlokk's Zulian Prowlers (15101), Bloodseeker Bats",
    "(11368), Frenzied Bloodseeker Bats (14965) and the Spawn of Mar'li (15041) on the wrong health per tier, and",
    "trash on Heroic and above weaker than on Normal: CoA's raid health x2.2 applies on Normal only. Health per",
    "player from the live logs: heart 19,959 Normal; prowler 3,304 and 6,212; bat 1,430 and 3,100; frenzied bat",
    "33,403 Mythic; Spawn of Mar'li 8,431 Mythic (tester value). The heart follows Hakkar's ladder (x1.88 Mythic,",
    "x2.32 Ascended: 37,523 and 46,305; user decision 2026-11-12), not the Ascended log's 95,396, whose Hakkar had",
    "about 5x his Normal health. Raid flex counts at least 10 players. A Mythic Gurubashi Headhunter (3,052",
    "level-60 warrior health x 11.2219) gets x1.88 x2.2 = 141,655 health, where the variant without the raid factor",
    "had 64,389. Each hero is alone in an instance."
  ],
